{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40733","headline":"和淮南太尉留题凤州王氏别业 · 李洞","name":"和淮南太尉留题凤州王氏别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清秋看长鹭雏成，说向湘僧亦动情。\n节屋折将松上影，印龛移锁月中声。\n野人陪赏增诗价，太尉因居着谷名。\n闲想此中遗胜事，宿斋吟遶凤池行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}